 "storyText": {
  "the-sleepy-cloud": [
   "A little cloud floated over the hill. She yawned a big, fluffy yawn.",
   "The sun was going down, and the sky turned pink and orange.",
   "Bird flew past. \"Goodnight, little cloud!\" she sang.",
   "The cloud looked for a soft place to rest. The hill was too pointy.",
   "The moon came up and made a silver bed in the sky.",
   "The little cloud curled up, closed her eyes, and drifted off to sleep. Goodnight!"
  ],
  "calm-breathing": [
   "Bolt's tower of blocks fell down. Crash! Bolt felt cross.",
   "His face went hot and his hands went tight.",
   "Pip said, \"Let's smell a flower and blow out a candle.\"",
   "Breathe in through your nose... like smelling a flower.",
   "Breathe out slowly... like blowing out a candle. Whoosh.",
   "Bolt felt calm again. Together, they built an even taller tower!"
  ],
  "pip-and-the-lost-seed": [
   "Pip had one tiny seed. \"Where shall I plant you?\" asked Pip.",
   "Whoosh! The wind blew the seed away.",
   "Pip looked under a leaf. No seed. Pip looked in a flower. No seed.",
   "A snail pointed with its feelers. \"Over there, in the soft soil!\"",
   "Rain came, and sun came. A little green shoot popped up.",
   "The lost seed had found the perfect home. It grew into a flower!"
  ],
  "nova-counts-the-stars": [
   "When the sky was dark, Nova liked to count the stars.",
   "One star, two stars, three stars, twinkling high.",
   "Four stars, five stars, a little line of light.",
   "A cloud drifted by and hid some stars. \"Come back!\" said Nova.",
   "The cloud moved on. Six, seven, eight, nine, ten!",
   "\"Goodnight, stars,\" whispered Nova. \"I'll count you again tomorrow.\""
  ]
 }
}
